      "club": "wob"
     },
     {
      "name": "Man City",
      "value": "signed him",
      "club": "mci"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "His agent says he even agreed personal terms with Bayern. But the clubs never agreed a price.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "text",
    "heading": "BAYERN, SO CLOSE",
    "body": "De Bruyne's agent later said a personal agreement was reached with Bayern after two meetings. The deal fell apart over the fee."
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "City paid a fee reported at more than fifty million pounds, their club record at the time.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "title": "AUGUST 2015",
    "items": [
     {
      "n": "£50m+",
      "l": "reported fee"
     },
     {
      "n": "2015",
      "l": "club record then"
     }
    ],
    "person": "kdb"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "He said City's style of football just suited him better.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "person",
    "person": "kdb",
    "label": "\"CITY SUITED ME\"",
    "mood": "happy"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Ten years later: six Premier League titles, one hundred and eight goals, one hundred and seventy assists.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "title": "KDB AT CITY",
    "items": [
     {
      "n": "6",
      "l": "Premier League titles"
     },
